# The files below are byte-pinned by recorded sha256 digests: data/scenarios/
# manifest.json for the scenario fixtures, and artifacts/handoffs/P01-01/dsh/
# evidence.json for the two dependency locks. Pin LF so a clean checkout on
# Linux, macOS and Windows all produce byte-identical files: with core.autocrlf
# a Windows checkout turned them into CRLF and the hash checks failed on CI.
# Scoped to the hash-pinned files only, so unrelated fixtures keep their
# current bytes and the diff stays reviewable.
data/scenarios/manifest.json text eol=lf
data/scenarios/tiny_master.json text eol=lf
data/scenarios/coldchain_chain_10.json text eol=lf
uv.lock text eol=lf
package-lock.json text eol=lf
